{"articleNo":"3156","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=3156&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] 삼성소프트웨어멤버십 2011년 하반기 신입회원 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.05.09","hit":"28711","attachments":[{"name":"삼성소프트웨어멤버십 2011년 하반기 신입회원 모집.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=3156&attachNo=22753"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #193da9; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">\"</span><span style=\"COLOR: #193da9; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">세계 최초가 되거나</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #193da9; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"COLOR: #193da9; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">세계 최고가 되라</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #193da9; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">\"</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #474747; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1991</span><span style=\"COLOR: #474747; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년에 설립된 삼성소프트웨어멤버십은 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #474747; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">IT </span><span style=\"COLOR: #474747; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">연구개발에 열정적이고 창의적인 재능이 있는 </span><span style=\"COLOR: #474747; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">대학생을 조기 발굴하여 잠재 능력을 키우고 개발 역량을 마음껏 발휘할 수 있도록 지원하는 곳입니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #474747; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"COLOR: #474747; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">전공에 상관없이 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #474747; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">IT</span><span style=\"COLOR: #474747; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">연구개발에 대한 열정을 가진 대학생이면 누구나 회원이 될 수 있으며</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #474747; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">,</span><span style=\"COLOR: #474747; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">사회에 첫 발을 내딛기 전에 여러분은 뛰어난 실력과 인적 네트워크를 고루 갖춘 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #474747; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">IT </span><span style=\"COLOR: #474747; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">전문가로 거듭날 수 있습니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #474747; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"COLOR: #474747; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">삼성소프트웨어멤버십에서는 아래와 같이 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #474747; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2011</span><span style=\"COLOR: #474747; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년 하반기 신입회원을 모집하고 있습니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #474747; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span><span style=\"COLOR: #474747; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">열정 넘치는 여러분의 많은 관심과 도전을 기대하겠습니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #474747; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #474747; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #474747; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: rgb(47,79,79); FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\">1.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"COLOR: rgb(47,79,79); FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">삼성 소프트웨어 멤버십 공개 설명회 일정</span></p>\n<span style=\"COLOR: rgb(47,79,79); FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: rgb(47,79,79)\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: rgb(47,79,79)\">□<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"COLOR: rgb(47,79,79)\">설명회 일정<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: rgb(47,79,79)\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2010년 5월 18일 (수) 16:00</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: rgb(47,79,79)\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: rgb(47,79,79)\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: rgb(47,79,79)\">□<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"COLOR: rgb(47,79,79)\">설명회 장소<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: rgb(47,79,79)\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 글로벌관</span></p>\n<span st